; messages.iss
; ancora's own setup messages, one set per [Languages] entry in ancora.iss.
; Saved as UTF-8 with a BOM so Inno Setup reads the non-Latin text correctly.
; Machine drafted, like the panel translations in gui\lang; a native review is welcome.

[CustomMessages]
english.SteamVRRunning=SteamVR is running. Close SteamVR, then press OK to continue.
english.SteamVRRunningUninstall=SteamVR is running. Close SteamVR, then press OK to uninstall ancora.
english.Registering=Registering ancora with SteamVR...

